---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="bg-olive-deep rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-14 shadow-card">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
      <span class="inline-block bg-cream/10 text-white text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full">48-hour turnaround</span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight text-cream">The Booking Funnel Audit</h2>
      <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-cream/90 leading-snug">Find Out Exactly Where You're Losing Bookings — Plus the highest-impact fixes to win them back.</h3>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base sm:text-lg text-cream/70 leading-relaxed">
        We'll mystery-shop your own booking funnel — form, phone line, mobile flow, follow-up speed — the way a real client would. In 48 hours you get a plain-English report on your top 3-5 leaks. No obligation to work with us further.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card text-center">
        <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-olive">20-30%</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed text-[18px]">of enquiries typically leak before booking</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card text-center">
        <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-olive">62%</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed text-[18px]">of calls to service businesses go unanswered
          <a href="https://www.getaira.io/blog/missed-business-calls-statistics" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="block mt-1 text-sm text-olive hover:text-charcoal">— 411 Locals study</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card text-center">
        <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-olive">89%</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed text-[18px]">of customers expect a reply within 1 hour — the average business misses that by ~11 hours
          <a href="https://greetnow.com/blog/customer-response-time-statistics" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="block mt-1 text-sm text-olive hover:text-charcoal">— GreetNow, 2026</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center">
      <a href="#book-a-demo" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 bg-gold text-charcoal pl-5 sm:pl-8 pr-1.5 sm:pr-2 py-1.5 sm:py-2 rounded-full text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold shadow-card hover:brightness-105 hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all">
        <span>Get My <span class="line-through opacity-60">$197</span> FREE Booking Audit</span>
        <span class="w-7 h-7 sm:w-11 sm:h-11 rounded-full bg-charcoal flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <Icon name="move-up-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 sm:w-5 sm:h-5 text-gold" />
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
